    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1a1a2e;\n      --card: #16213e;\n      --accent: #e94560;\n      --text: #f0f0f0;\n      --input-bg: #0f3460;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card);\n      padding: 32px;\n      border-radius: 0;\n      border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 360px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .row > div { flex: 1; }\n    label {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n    input, select, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 12px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      background: var(--input-bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      border-radius: 0;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n      border-color: #fff;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n    }\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      transition: transform 0.05s;\n    }\n    button:hover { background: #ff5a7a; }\n    button:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n    .result-box {\n      margin-top: 24px;\n      padding: 16px;\n      background: var(--input-bg);\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      min-height: 64px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card { padding: 20px; }\n      body { font-size: 16px; }\n      .row { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"left\">Left</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"left\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"right\">Right</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"right\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\" id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  const rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  const operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function compute() {\n    const leftVal = leftInput.value.trim();\n    const rightVal = rightInput.value.trim();\n    const op = operationSelect.value;\n\n    if (leftVal === '' || rightVal === '') {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const a = Number(leftVal);\n    const b = Number(rightVal);\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(a) || !Number.isFinite(b)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    let result;\n    switch (op) {\n      case 'add': result = a + b; break;\n      case 'subtract': result = a - b; break;\n      case 'multiply': result = a * b; break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (b === 0) {\n          resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n          return;\n        }\n        result = a / b;\n        break;\n      default:\n        resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    resultEl.textContent = String(result);\n  }\n\n  calculateBtn.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n  [leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(el => {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        compute();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Two-Number Calculator\n\nA simple offline calculator with a pixel aesthetic. Performs addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division on two numbers.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in the **Left** field.\n3. Enter a number in the **Right** field.\n4. Choose an operation from the dropdown (Add, Subtract, Multiply, Divide).\n5. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any input field).\n6. The result appears in the output box below the button.\n\n## Error Handling\n\nThe calculator displays `Error` in the result box when:\n- Either input is empty.\n- Either input is not a finite number (e.g., `Infinity`, `NaN`, or non-numeric text).\n- Division by zero is attempted.\n\n## Features\n\n- Supports negative numbers.\n- Result is shown as a plain numeric value (no label).\n- Initial result is `0`.\n- Keyboard accessible: all controls are labeled and focusable; pressing Enter triggers calculation.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width.\n- Pixel-style visuals using CSS only (no images or external assets).\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Offline: no network requests, external assets, iframes, or server code.\n- No packages, imports, or storage.\n- Plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript only.\n- Uses `addEventListener` for event handling (no inline handlers).\n- Relative paths only (`.html`, `.css`, `.js`, `.md`).\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — Structure and styling.\n- `script.js` — Calculator logic.\n- `README.md` — This file.\n\n## Palette\n\n- Background: `#1a1a2e`\n- Card: `#16213e`\n- Accent: `#e94560`\n- Text: `#f0f0f0`\n- Input background: `#0f3460`\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
